            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Wow—thank you for such a glowing review, Gina! We’re so thrilled to hear this was your best vacation rental experience yet. It’s wonderful that the layout, amenities, and shared spaces worked so well for your group and that everyone had both comfort and privacy. We’re especially happy to know our team could support you along the way. We’d love to welcome you back for another memorable stay!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This home was the best vacation rental we have stayed in. Each bedroom with its own bathroom was luxurious for 7 families. The living space with two master bedrooms was perfect for our older companions. Having the deck in main living area looking over the pool was absolutely perfect. The kitchen was a chefs kitchen and the dining table large enough for 15 people was fun. The location and outdoor spaces were perfect for stormy days where the beach wasn’t ideal. Having multiple mini refrigerators/coffee makers helped each family enjoy their own space. We look forward to another vacation at this home. The property management was very responsive and helpful on all of our questions before/during the stay.",
